Seeding Mechanism in _init_no_fly_zones():
  - Starting coordinate RNG: random.Random(world.seed + 100)
  - Pattern selection: Deterministic slice active_pool[:n_no_fly_zones] when n <= 3;
                       random.Random(world.seed + 10).choice(active_pool) when n > 3.
  - Individual zone seed: world.seed * 1000 + zone_idx
  - Held-out mechanism: if include_held_out=True, appends HELD_OUT_PATTERNS to patterns_to_place.
  - Pure function property: position_at(t) = path[t % len(path)] (deterministic repeating cycle).

